    "detailed_description": "Take part in the fight for humanity's freedom in AI Olympius!<br>Join the resistance and conquer the top of Olympus of the artificial intelligence that has equated itself to a god in a story-driven third-person shooter with RPG elements.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/cc8fb0c154862e3b3b52c7a7330c6420.avif?t=1754159402\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variability of the world</h2>The game's missions occur in different parts of the planet, so each sector differs from the previous one.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/4f53a0d1c1301f46f6f89267db43e91c.poster.avif?t=1754159402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/4f53a0d1c1301f46f6f89267db43e91c.webm?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/4f53a0d1c1301f46f6f89267db43e91c.mp4?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early access</h2>The game has 17 campaign missions available for about 9-14 hours of gameplay. Another part of the story is in development.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rebel technologies</h2>Collect resources, develop your character, improve your skills, and unlock new abilities to fight artificial intelligence.<br>The game offers over 60 weapon and costume modifications<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/6649155167ae95deaba82c126c834afe.avif?t=1754159402\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play together</h2>The game supports two-player co-op in split-screen mode on the same computer or via Remote Play.<br>Later, a full-fledged multiplayer will be available, which is currently under development.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.poster.avif?t=1754159402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.webm?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.mp4?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind control</h2>Capture enemy robots, or make allied machines right on the battlefield.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.poster.avif?t=1754159402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.webm?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.mp4?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Base building</h2>Create, defend, and improve your base to extract resources in the additional game mode intertwined with the main storyline.",
