 is currently under development.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.poster.avif?t=1754159402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.webm?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1789c0130f3a9b8635541cbb1b300331.mp4?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind control</h2>Capture enemy robots, or make allied machines right on the battlefield.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.poster.avif?t=1754159402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.webm?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478970/extras/1c4d0c84f7535efcb302a366c3eb685c.mp4?t=1754159402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Base building</h2>Create, defend, and improve your base to extract resources in the additional game mode intertwined with the main storyline.",
